@40049 = ~Clairvoyance grants the caster foresight of incoming danger, making the caster immune to backstab attacks for the duration of the spell. The spell lasts for 3 rounds at 5th level, plus 1 additional round every 2 levels thereafter, to a maximum of 10 rounds at 19th level.~
